   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hi Noah, you now have access to hr-analytics.\n\nThis group is classed as sensitive, so it needed two approvals. Your manager, Carmen Diaz, is currently on leave and her delegate's window ended on October 27. Simone Adler approved in her place, and Elena Rossi, the group owner, also approved. Both approvals are on record, and I've added you to the group.\n\nYour ticket, T-6012, is marked resolved. If the dashboard work also needs a license or other access, let me know."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that's great. I'll check that I can open the group and the dashboard now.\n\nQuick question on the approvals: my manager is on leave, so who was covering her approvals? I just want to know who to go to if something else comes up while she's out."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Simone Adler covered Carmen's approvals. She's Carmen's manager, and the delegation that had been set up for Carmen's approvals, to Peter Lindqvist, ended on October 27. So the approval passed up one level to Simone.\n\nIf something else comes up while Carmen is out (leave runs through November 15), contact Simone Adler for manager-level approvals. Peter's delegation has expired, so he isn't covering anymore unless HR sets up a new one. I'd check with Simone or People Ops if you're not sure who to go to."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Got it, thanks. So Simone is the one to go to for manager-level approvals while Carmen is out, and I'll check with her or People Ops if I'm not sure. I'll try opening hr-analytics and the dashboard now and reach back out here if anything's missing."
  },
  {
